{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-14_end","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-14","title":"拒绝哀悼","storyCode":"15-15","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-14_end.txt","sourceHash":"dd25fdff25e5938a0752c770a37bcaddf9a9c74d7a145f106ada6309a950a250","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"众人突破危机，从石棺中救下了虚弱的凯尔希，并且整队完毕，准备进入Abyss面对来自罗德岛内部的危机——失控的PRTS的核心组件，以及可能已苏醒的普瑞赛斯。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"},{"type":"narration","text":"“生命”这一概念如此空泛，却又对我们充满了致命的吸引力。\n我们已经习惯了将所有与我们拥有类似思考模式的个体视为生命，仅仅因为“他们有多么地像我们”......\n仅仅是因为我们都会为了生存下去，不惜一切代价地与死亡做抗争。\n但这是一种傲慢，{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"目标已经消灭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Stormeye，四点钟方向，两击连射。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"对着墙体支柱？"},{"type":"narration","text":"Stormeye虽然很疑惑，但依旧毫不犹豫地连续射出了两箭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"地形在我出手的瞬间发生了变化，障碍物刚好消失，命中敌方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，你怎么做到的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，不是我，是ZOOT算出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，六点钟方向，直接跳下去。别害怕空洞下面的源石晶簇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他直直飞跃而下，地形再次变化。他开始了永无止境的下坠，直到咒言编织的绳索拉住了他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔算得很准。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_167","isRemote":false,"text":"我已在此等候多时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聆听指引，闭目前行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我们赞扬抗争的勇气，宣扬反抗的美德。\n于是，遵循同一思考模式的生命前赴后继地加入那希望渺茫的队伍中。\n可在真正的神明面前，也许......\n我们所有的抗争在祂看来，就像自然界最微不足道的变化。\n也许，祂甚至从未注意到我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可视范围内所有敌对目标，成功摧毁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隔离区防线已建立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干得漂亮，小猫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，就是没有给我留几个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，接下来怎么办？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒计时三十秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下一波敌人会在你们正前方出现，全力清除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那里会开启通往博士必经之路的新通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！那可以让罪魁祸首再狠狠心疼一波了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小猫，这次让我先动手如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你并不赞同我，对吧，{@nickname}？\n我并非笃定这就是解读真相的钥匙，只是在确定那个可以预见的绝望会摧毁我们现有的所有努力之后——\n我只能把触手可及的希望紧紧握在自己的手中。\n我对生命的奇迹倾注了太多的爱，以至于我愈发清晰地看到了我们无法摒弃的软弱和缺陷。\n我又该如何去相信我爱的每一个人？相信......你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没用！可露希尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周围的建筑结构开始收缩了，它们试图挤压我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放出去的无人机也无法找到任何可行的路径，加固设备也撑不了太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在算了！在算了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ZOOT正在同时处理很庞大的信息，给她一点时间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"6，5，4，3，2......1！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mechanist，抬头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"阴影中的天花板开始扭曲，一道泛着寒光的刀锋划出了一条通往未知的道路。\n随后一只手从中伸了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人说你需要搭把手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"时间紧迫，只好用些非常手段了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧了，Mechanist！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大伙都在等你呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"我无法准确地估算我们下一次的重逢会是何时——\n但我很确定，那时我们必然已经失去了如今我们所拥有的一切。\n没有生命永远不会陨落，也没有逝去的人能在时间的尽头重聚。\n但我仍然希望，那时我能见到你......{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（愤怒的嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（咆哮）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（积蓄能量）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（释放炙热的光束）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"激射而出的光束在把源石结晶体围拢成的包围圈撕裂开一个巨大的口子后，继续向着远处扫射过去......击倒了越来越多的源石结晶体——\n但突然，它被某种力量挡住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"力道不错嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但小心别伤到博士，Mon3tr。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已就位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你带领着众人从黑暗中走了出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希就在这。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（欢快地抖擞身体）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"支援Mon3tr。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"净空石棺周围的敌人。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随时策应我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咒言随行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......就是石棺？就一直被隐藏在本舰内？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我初次醒来的地方......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ZOOT识别到凯尔希的信号在减弱！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"必须尽快确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希在里面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照Raidian的说法来看，她的状态可不怎么乐观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我们需要尽快让她离开那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再拖延下去，我担心......她的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能妄动，我们并不清楚凯尔希与石棺的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据当初的作战纪录，在切尔诺伯格时也有人接触了石棺，最后却产生了我们都没预料到的变故。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希不一样。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"交给我。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"掩护我。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你毫不迟疑地向石棺走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你触碰到了冰冷的石棺，它......在回应你。\n不，是凯尔希在回应你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"接下来我们还得一起继续向前呢。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虚弱的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你们来得很及时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虚弱的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......怎么样了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你向石棺中的人伸出了手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家都还平安。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"多亏你的努力。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"欢迎回来，凯尔希。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"她拉住了你的手，你能感觉到她前所未有地脆弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你看上去不是很好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"刚刚发生了什么事？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必在意我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借助石棺介入PRTS很困难，但意料之外的是，我收到了一份礼物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于PRTS和普瑞赛斯的更多情报，我会马上共享给你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（紧张的嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用害怕，Mon3tr。我还站在你面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会抛下你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我已经找到了通往Abyss的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场混乱该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里受到的干扰很强，我们已经极为靠近Abyss。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里没有路了，Abyss彻底把自己隐藏起来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这个距离内，我可以清楚地判断出它的位置。"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希站在最深处的墙壁之前，深深地吸了一口气。\n她从未走到如此深入的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦虑的低鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"别担心，Mon3tr。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我会陪着她。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你走到了凯尔希的身边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也在，凯尔希医生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛会共同面对威胁。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这次的结果，也许的确会不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我通过石棺保留了部分权限，我来打开一条通路。"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯尔希触碰到了那堵隔绝了你们与Abyss的墙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"警告：检测到异常能源涌动。\n警告：备用能源不足。\n警告：引擎动力能源不足，引擎已熄火。\n警告：能源动力层已离线。\n警告：顶层甲板已离线。\n警告：通讯系统已离线。\n警告：核心组件检测到不可修复损伤。\n抱歉，可——可露希——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“零号油罐”......谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本舰也终于停下了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，护住博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来你所有的行动都可以视博士的状况自行判断。从未知敌人的威胁中保护博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也需要你在博士自身出现任何异样时，限制博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（信任的低吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，时刻注意Dr.{@nickname}的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦我们进入Abyss，我们对于现实的一切认知都有可能受到冲击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危险随时会发生，但你和博士的安危永远是最高优先级。那个最终的威胁，只有你们才能应对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我会小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有其他需要我注意的事情吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信你的本心即可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我并未预想到这种局面到来得如此迅速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在内化宇宙和特里蒙的经历让我重新思考了许多，你已经让我看到了另一种可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来发生的任何事情，对你，对我，对罗德岛的所有人而言，都是未知数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，Dr.{@nickname}，我需要你告诉我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否还对可能面对的危险有任何的迟疑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"没有。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但并非担忧面前的危险。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希，你依旧试图隐藏自己的紧张和犹豫。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不必独自承受所有的压力。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（赞同地戳戳凯尔希）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这一次，我和罗德岛都站在你的身边。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有你们在，我并不担心面前的危险。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我反倒担心你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在进入这片区域后极其紧张。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（不安的低吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"请相信，我和罗德岛与你同在。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"告诉我接下来需要做什么。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经唤醒了开启Abyss的程序，开启舱室所需的能源已经准备就绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我并没有进入Abyss的完整权限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那需要我们砸进去吗？或许Misery也能想出些办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Abyss堪称整个泰拉隐蔽程度和安全等级最高的区域之一，目前只有一个人有权限打开这里。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你感受到了凯尔希的眼光聚焦在了你的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......如果需要我的话。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不会退缩。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十七年前，当“罗德岛”号终于被我找到的时候，其大部分结构都在漫长的岁月里被侵蚀破坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有处于核心位置的Abyss和其周边的区域保存依旧完好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依托于Abyss中的未知能源，PRTS也依旧在正常运转，并成为了后来我们所依仗的指挥系统的底层框架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可Abyss，从未再有人开启过，至今已经有......万余年。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i11_1R"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到三年前，当“阿喃那”彻底降临的时候，我开始意识到危机降临的速度已经超出了我的预计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那一场混乱，我们中的许多人都曾亲历。遗憾与悲痛令我们至今记忆犹新。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡纶沉默地举起了袖刃，时刻戒备着任何可能突发的危机。\nRaidian感知到了阿斯卡纶的微妙异常，习惯性利用源石技艺安抚了阿斯卡纶，还有在场的每一位同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三年来，我们不断加强本舰的防御，数次演练如何应对试图从内部瓦解罗德岛的威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是各位干员的齐心协力，才让我们能够在意外突发时迅速锁定危机的源头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i11_1L"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然而，我们已经来到浓雾的边缘，更进一步便是一片未知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也犹豫过。但博士说得对，我们可以解决这次危机，就像过往的每一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们一直同在。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos的骨笔在空中轻挥，言辞自他口中而出，庇佑随后便到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们很久没有如此整齐地共同行动了，感受如何，Logos？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"专注。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i11_1M"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"按照此前的情报来推断，Abyss中不止存放着PRTS的核心组件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其中的石棺中极有可能休眠着一位名为“普瑞赛斯”的个体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果普瑞赛斯醒来，我需要你们集全力以最快速度抹除她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这会是我们避免意外的最好办法，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚苏醒之时会是她最虚弱的时刻......适应现如今的环境也需要一些时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士......？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你触碰到了面前的墙，奇异的触感让你心跳加速。\n你有一种直觉。这个地方在等待着你，或者说......这里本就是为你而存在。\n墙在颤抖。你似乎还听到了警报声，它几乎要刺破你的耳膜。\n你产生了刹那的恍惚，那刺耳的声音来自现在，还是来自过去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Abyss正在发生变化！"},{"type":"narration","text":"墙面开始出现不规则的移动，一条裂缝开始产生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i11_2M"},{"type":"narration","text":"气流自裂缝中涌动而出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“面纱”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女妖的咒言化作无形的屏障，挡住了汹涌的气流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"退后，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人戒备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（高昂的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"......Dr.{@nickname}......\n......没想到现在不想松手的会是我。\n<color=#888888>凯尔希</color>\n阿米娅，注意保护博士。\n<color=#888888>阿米娅</color>\n嗯。\n粉色的丝线自她的法杖上盘旋而起，黑色的王冠浮现于她的头顶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#888888>Raidian</color>\n电磁通讯场已建立。\nMantra的声音也在你的心中响起——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#888888>Mantra</color>\n需要协助，只需心中一念。我们都在。\n<color=#888888>Stormeye</color>\n替我掩护侧翼怎么样，Sharp？\n<color=#888888>Sharp</color>\n那你最好把弓拿稳了。\nDr.{@nickname}，我相信我们之间的联系会超越时间与空间。\n在那用黑暗与星点光芒装饰过的文明尽头，我们也一样会再见面。一定。\n我会等到那一天。\n<color=#888888>煌</color>\n小猫，要帮忙就喊我！\n<color=#888888>迷迭香</color>\n哦。\n<color=#888888>Pith</color>\n周围环境正在压制我们的源石技艺，但源石弧似乎还能奏效。\n<color=#888888>Touch</color>\n一会儿放心大胆行动。\n<color=#888888>Misery</color>\n博士，我可以先行进入确认情况——"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不，我有一种预感......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这里没有任何威胁。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#888888>凯尔希</color>\n但这反倒更加让我担忧。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我先进入，跟紧我。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#888888>阿米娅</color>\n我和你一起。\n<color=#888888>Mon3tr</color>\n（坚定的低吼）\n<color=#888888>凯尔希</color>\n各位，准备好，罗德岛的存亡已经掌握在我们的手中。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们一起。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你们踏进了裂缝之后的空间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#000000>我肯定会等到那一天。等我。</color>\n<color=#000000>\n\n你也要等我。</color>"}],"observedOperators":[]}
